      <author>Themis Qi</author>
      <dc:creator>Themis Qi</dc:creator>
      <description>International investors will keep an eye on a forum next week for clues from China’s regulators on how they plan to further open its financial markets, after Visa’s long-awaited approval fuelled hopes for deeper participation in the world’s second-largest economy.
Regulators could announce more measures at the Financial Street Forum to deepen the internationalisation of the yuan and optimise the Connect series of cross-border investment links between investors in mainland China and the rest of...</description>
