      <description>The wallpaper on Allan Zeman’s office desktop computer screen is an image of Chandara, the private estate in Phuket that he has owned for more than two decades. Now the “father of Lan Kwai Fong” is bringing the Thai resort-style concept to Hong Kong’s luxury housing market.
